# SEO audits: quality first

When fixing SEO audit scores for this site:

## Do change (invisible / head only)

- `<title>` and `meta description` via `src/config/pageSeo.ts` or layout props
- Canonical, hreflang, JSON-LD, sitemap, robots
- Caching headers, build/deploy config, performance (defer, compress) without layout changes
- Default blog `<title>` suffix (`pageTitle` uses `| Cheats`, not `| AION Cheats`)

## Do NOT change unless the user explicitly asks

- Visible **H1, H2, H3**, hero copy, section headers
- **Blog post titles, body, cards**, forum copy
- **Nav, footer, and i18n labels** (structure or wording)
- UI, layout, CSS, or components for audit “paste” text

Audit tools may flag “title words missing from H1”—**do not** rewrite headings to match; keep on-page quality and only tune title/meta.
